			"notes": "CritsAddons 1.2.1 Release Notes\nAdded\nAdded bundled first-install defaults:\nDefault CritsAddons/NoammAddons config.\nDefault secretRoutes.json.\nDefault custom font file.\nAdded Stat Display feature:\nHealth bar\nMana bar\nHealth number\nMana number\nOverflow mana number\nEHP number\nDefense number\nSpeed number\nHide default stats option\nHide experience bar option\nAdded Custom Font feature for loading a .ttf font from config/CritsAddons/fonts.\nAdded README documentation for all current CritsAddons features.\nChanged\nUpdated mod version to 1.2.1.\nFresh installs now automatically create default files if they are missing.\nDefault installer does not overwrite existing user config, routes, or font files.\nUpdated Secret Routes startup to ensure bundled default routes are available before loading.\nNotes\nExisting users keep their current configs and routes.\nNew users get the bundled config and active secret routes automatically on first launch.\nIf installing manually, remove older CritsAddons jars from the mods folder before launching to avoid duplicate mod loading."
		},
